Monster is an abstract class:
	Use a constructor to initialize variables
Name
Health
Damage type 
Damage output
Stamina
Defence

	Abstract double attack()
	Public double specialAttack()
	Public void block()
If attacked: do zero damage

DAMAGE_TYPES is an enumeration 
	- BLUNT
	- SLASH
	- MAGIC

Regular Monster inherits Monster: 
	Public double attack(damage output, damage type)	
Lowers targets health by dmg_output x damage_type
Return dmg 

Brute inherits Monster: 
	Initialize:
		- Bleed dmg
		- Bleed chance
	Public double attack(damage output, damage type, bleed dmg, bleed chance)	
Lowers targets health by dmg_output x damage_type
Inflict bleed (50%)
Return dmg & bleed dmg

IceMonster inherits Monster:
	Initialize:
		- Freeze chance
	Public double attack(damage output, damage type)	
Lowers targets health by dmg_output x damage_type
Return dmg
	Public double specialAttack(damage output, damage type, Freeze chance)	
Lowers targets health by dmg_output x damage_type
Inflict freeze (20%) for rand turns
Return dmg & freeze turns
	Public int freeze(Freeze chance)	
Inflict freeze (20%) for rand turns
Return freeze turns


